===========================================================
VALIDATION RULE 1
===========================================================

Rule Name:
Customer_Required

Purpose:
Ensure that the customer field is not empty.

Formula:

ISBLANK(Customer__c)

Error Message:

Please select a customer.

Error Location:

Top of Page


===========================================================
VALIDATION RULE 2
===========================================================

Rule Name:
Product_Required

Purpose:
Ensure that the product field is not empty.

Formula:

ISBLANK(Product__c)

Error Message:

Please select a product.

Error Location:

Top of Page


===========================================================
VALIDATION RULE 3
===========================================================

Rule Name:
Invalid_Order_Date

Purpose:
Prevent users from entering future dates.

Formula:

Order_Date__c > TODAY()

Error Message:

Order date cannot be greater than today's date.

Error Location:

Top of Page


===========================================================
VALIDATION RULE 4
===========================================================

Rule Name:
Order_Number_Validation

Purpose:
Ensure that the order number is greater than zero.

Formula:

Order_Number__c <= 0

Error Message:

Please enter a valid order number.

Error Location:

Top of Page

